    "signature_algorithm": "hex HMAC-SHA256 of \"{nonce}.{raw_body}\" in Webhook-Signature: t={nonce},s={signature}",
    "note": "Deterministic offline fixtures: bodies are base64-encoded compact JSON and the Webhook-Signature header is precomputed over the exact decoded bytes with the secret supplied in grpc_req.webhook_secrets. webhook_signatures.rs has no \"nmi\" signer arm (plan P-IncomingWebhook-06 withdrawn; the file is out of scope), so the harness cannot compute one -- same arrangement as connector_specs/cryptopay. webhook_secret_key names a key that is absent from creds.json on purpose: a real nmi webhook_secret must not overwrite grpc_req.webhook_secrets and invalidate these signatures. No signature_header key, so the harness never tries to sign."
  },
